  - assistant-quality JSON no-cheat gate covers raw `status=` and `reason=` field evidence from structured JSON helper generation; repaired raw fields now fail with `json_raw_field_required_repair:<key>` instead of silently certifying assistant-quality, while clean raw fields remain accepted. Verification passed 2026-07-10 with `cargo test -p tinyrustlm-runtime` (165 unit tests plus 2 eval CLI tests).
